  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759768,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1500 DS Spirits Vol. 6: Trump - Nintendo DS Description\n\nDive into the quirky and strategic world of *1500 DS Spirits Vol. 6: Trump*, a unique card game for the Nintendo DS that blends collectible card battling with a surprising Trump-themed twist! This installment in the popular *1500 DS Spirits* series features a fresh roster of spirits, each inspired by iconic figures and moments, presented in a playful and often satirical manner.\n\nGameplay revolves around building a deck of spirits and strategically deploying them to outwit your opponent. Utilize their unique abilities and elemental strengths to gain an advantage. The \"Trump\" element introduces a dynamic layer, where certain spirits gain significant power based on the current Trump card in play, adding an element of unpredictability and requiring adaptable strategies. \n\nBeyond the core battling, *1500 DS Spirits Vol. 6: Trump* includes a robust single-player campaign, challenging tutorials, and online multiplayer modes to test your skills against other players. Collect, trade, and master your deck to become the ultimate spirit summoner!"
    },
